SUMMARY:Talent Show/ Open Mic Night
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nDo you ha
 ve a talent or act that you would like to present to everyone now is your 
 one and only chance come show us what you got! Audience is welcome!\n\n**I
 f you would like to sign up to preform please email me at [rothscd1@tcnj.e
 du](mailto:rothscd1@tcnj.edu) with subject line talent show preform!**
